; Title-screen loop — dusk bells (the "faster" variant, chosen 2026-07-02).
; Cold tolls on A4 (the routine's floor — the dark note), the E5→C5 dusk
; motif as a lamp lit far off, a small warm rise, D5 left hanging so the
; loop leans back into the toll. Split into cells at integration; poll the
; keyboard between calls. Audition: build198x beeper title-dusk.bpr --repeat 3

phrase title_dusk
  A4 300ms                ; the toll — cold ground
  rest 10
  A4 300ms
  rest 13
  E5 220ms                ; the dusk motif, a lamp far off
  rest 4
  C5 300ms
  rest 13
  A4 300ms                ; the toll returns
  rest 10
  C5 180ms                ; a small warmth kindles
  rest 3
  E5 180ms
  rest 4
  D5 400ms                ; left hanging — leans back into the dark
  rest 16
